msgstr "Ahora no puedo comprobar tu voz."

#: src/dictate-window.c
msgid ""
"Voice match was updated since your voice was recorded. Record it again and I "
"can check it."
msgstr ""
"La identificación por voz se actualizó después de grabar tu voz. Vuelve a "
"grabarla y podré comprobarla."

#: src/dictate-window.c
msgid ""
"The voice model is not installed any more, so I can't tell your voice from "
"anyone else's."
msgstr ""
"El modelo de voz ya no está instalado, así que no puedo distinguir tu voz de "
"la de otros."

#. the model is there and the sample made for it, and the check failed to run
#: src/dictate-window.c
msgid ""
"Voice match couldn't run just now, so I can't tell your voice from anyone "
"else's."
msgstr ""
"La identificación por voz no pudo funcionar ahora, así que no puedo "
"distinguir tu voz de la de otros."

#: src/dictate-window.c
msgid "Use PIN instead"
msgstr "Usar el PIN"

#: src/dictate-window.c
msgid "Unlock with PIN instead"
msgstr "Desbloquear con PIN"

