msgid ""
"A cold or a new microphone can do that. Enter your PIN and I'll learn it "
"again."
msgstr ""
"Un resfriado o un micrófono nuevo pueden causarlo. Introduce tu PIN y la "
"volveré a aprender."

#: src/dictate-window.c
msgid ""
"A cold or a new microphone can do that. Record your voice again and I'll "
"learn it."
msgstr ""
"Un resfriado o un micrófono nuevo pueden causarlo. Vuelve a grabar tu voz y "
"la aprenderé."

#: src/dictate-window.c
msgid "Not now"
msgstr "Ahora no"

#: src/dictate-window.c
msgid "Enter PIN"
msgstr "Introducir PIN"

#: src/dictate-window.c
msgid "Until then, commands in this voice are not carried out"
msgstr "Hasta entonces, no se ejecutan comandos con esta voz"

